\fs96 \cf2 Get started with Mojo\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa400\partightenfactor0

\fs32 \cf2 Get ready to learn Mojo! This tutorial gives you a tour of Mojo by building a complete program that does much more than simply printing "Hello, world!"\
We'll build a version of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Conway%27s_Game_of_Life"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \ul \ulc5 Conway's Game of Life}}, which is a simulation of self-replicating systems. If you haven't heard of it before, don't worry\'97it will make sense when you see it in action. Let's get started so you can learn Mojo programming basics, including the following:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls4\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Using basic built-in types like 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb12 Int
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1  and 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb12 String
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1 \
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Using a 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb12 List
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1  to manage a sequence of values\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Creating custom types in the form of structs (data structures)\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Creating and importing Mojo modules\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Importing and using Python libraries\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa400\partightenfactor0
\cf2 There's a lot to learn, but we've tried to keep the explanations simple. If you just want to see the finished code, you can {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://github.com/modular/modular/tree/modular/v26.2/mojo/examples/life"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \ul \ulc5 get it on GitHub}}.\
